{
  "about": "The base: the shared pack every other pack relies on, the file base.pack, which every unit with open-field needs. It holds the interface for packs by anyone, levels 1 to 10 of a pack's card (docs/base.md): words and pictures on the unit's screens, a page of its own, painting and text on it, folders and files, a sequencer, sound stages and working memory, values kept with the tapes and the sounds, effects and synth engines in the unit's own lists, and the value as a sound plays it; and, since base 32, a pack's own settings in the unit's settings list. Nothing in it is made for one pack: our four features use the same cards as anyone's. It also holds the door the install page talks to over USB MIDI. Its release, `release`, is what the start screen shows behind the words open-field. Not named on the start screen.",
